# 2-5 KANINJAKTEN — BOSS: Jättekaninen (DESIGN §10.2). A chase level: the giant rabbit comes from behind and hops
# after Bo; keep the speed up, hop over the pits and onto the stumps without stopping. Its landings shake the ground
# (Bo loses speed), so there are no jump arcs here: an apple on a stump says "up here", apples on both sides of a
# pit say "over it". The last kicker takes Bo over the brook; the rabbit stops at the edge, sniffs, finds the
# carrots and eats. The `enemy rabbit` object marks where it stops (boss_step brings it on from behind).
name  KANINJAKTEN
world 2
music 7
rows  16
start 6

