h 4
flat 40         # 0-39    start: the rabbit comes from behind
gap 3           # 40-42   a little pit
flat 30         # 43-72   stumps
up22 2          # 73-76   (h6)
flat 20         # 77-96   flag
down22 2        # 97-100  (h4)
flat 40         # 101-140 a stump, flag
liq water
liquid 3        # 141-143 a little brook
flat 23         # 144-166 the carrots, the last kicker
liquid 4        # 167-170 the brook: the rabbit stops at its edge (a slowed-down jump clears it too)
flat 41         # 171-211 the goal

